usage: cli.py [-h]
              {exact,nqs,vqe,benchmark,noise,mitigate,qaoa,discover,experiment,results,doctor,validate}
              ...

Command line interface for bounded local scientific experiments.

positional arguments:
  {exact,nqs,vqe,benchmark,noise,mitigate,qaoa,discover,experiment,results,doctor,validate}
    exact               Run exact TFIM with provenance
    nqs                 Run nqs TFIM with provenance
    vqe                 Run vqe TFIM with provenance
    benchmark           Run benchmark TFIM with provenance
    noise               Run local noise experiment
    mitigate            Run local mitigate experiment
    qaoa                Run local qaoa experiment
    discover            Run local discover experiment
    experiment          Inspect or run the registry
    results             Plot or combine stored artifacts
    doctor              Report environment and optional dependencies
    validate            Run installed scientific validation suite

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
